SUMMARY:Laura Cortese
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Laura Cortese is a singer-songwriter\, fiddler\, and musical in
 stigator whose work bridges folk tradition and bold contemporary sound. Sh
 e is the bandleader\, principal songwriter\, and lead singer of Laura Cort
 ese & the Dance Cards\, performs an intimate\, high-energy solo show\, and
  plays in duo with her partner Bert Ruymbeek. Now based in Belgium\, she i
 s a recipient of the Flanders Folk Award.\nhttps://therockwell.org/calenda
 r/laura-cortese/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/laura-cortese/
END:VEVENT
