SUMMARY:ONELOUDDRAWING
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Jonah / onelinedrawing with a full band doing Far’s Tin Cans 
 on its 30th anniversary\, plust stuff from New End’s Thriller & the new 
 onelinedrawing album RAINBOWMACHINE ARTIST BIO: onelinedrawing is Jonah Ma
 tranga of Far\, Gratitude\, New End Original\, and more. On September 18\,
  Iodine Recordings will release RAINBOWMACHINE\, the new album from onelin
 edrawing. The album was produced by Jay Maas. It’s the loudest\, wildest
  onelinedrawing record yet. The tracks above are from the album. There wil
 l also be the first full-band onelinedrawing shows in forever in September
  and October\, celebrating the 30th anniversary of Far’s TIn Cans With S
 trings To You\, the 25th anniversary of Thriller\, and of course the new a
 lbum.\nhttps://therockwell.org/calendar/onelouddrawing/\nFrom Pushpin Bost
 on: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/onelouddrawing/
END:VEVENT
